@startuml FoodRescue_Delivery_Assignment_State

title FoodRescue — Pickup / Delivery Assignment State Diagram

[*] --> Unassigned

Unassigned --> Assigned : Volunteer assigned
Assigned --> "Pickup Scheduled" : Pickup time set
Assigned --> Unassigned : Volunteer rejects / unavailable

"Pickup Scheduled" --> "Picked Up" : Food collected
"Pickup Scheduled" --> Failed : Pickup failed
"Pickup Scheduled" --> Cancelled : Assignment cancelled

"Picked Up" --> "In Transit" : Delivery starts
"In Transit" --> Delivered : Delivery successful
"In Transit" --> Failed : Delivery fails

Delivered --> [*]
Failed --> Unassigned : Reassignment required
Failed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

@enduml